OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny showers
OL,6,Fover Galloway soon dying out.
OL,7,FOtherwise, dry with clear spells and
OL,8,Fbecoming rather chilly in the Southern
OL,9,FUpland glens with patchy fog
OL,10,Fdeveloping.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FEarly fog patches quickly
OL,13,Fclearing to leave a largely dry day
OL,14,Fwith sunny spells. Cloud will increase
OL,15,Fin the afternoon to bring the odd
OL,16,Flight shower.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
